# 10,000 iterations of random code in ring 3 (tests/programs/fuzz.asm): no
# panic, no reset, no hang, and the kernel's code and tables the same at
# every start. The kernel prints its counts of faults by vector.
program: fuzz
match: contains
timeout: 300
---
fuzz: starting
fuzz: faults
fuzz: faults inside the random bytes:
fuzz: 10000 iterations; the kernel's code and tables unchanged
